# Dev-only: the frontend (Vite, :5173) and backend (:8000) run on different
# ports here, unlike production where the built SPA is served same-origin by
# the gateway/monolith. This makes the Playground's copy-pasteable code
# snippets point at the real backend instead of the frontend dev server's
# own origin (see `src/lib/config.ts`). `vite.config.ts`'s dev proxy target
# is read from this same variable, so there's one place to change if the
# backend's dev port ever moves.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
